      <Docs>
        <summary>
          <para>This constant was deprecated in API level 31. Please use isTransient() instead of comparing the return value of getErrorCode() against SessionException.ERROR_RESOURCE_CONTENTION.</para>
          <para>This indicates that apps using MediaDrm sessions are temporarily exceeding the capacity of available crypto resources. The app should retry the operation later.</para>
